(4257, '\\core\\event\\config_log_created', 'core', 'created', 'config_log', 'config_log', 1984, 'c', 0, 1, 10, 0, 2, 0, NULL, 0, '{\"name\":\"footnote\",\"oldvalue\":\"<p>Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and tronic typesetting, sheets taining Lorem Ipsum passages.<br><a href=\\\"#\\\">Read More \\u00bb<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"value\":\"<p><strong data-path-to-node=\\\"3,0\\\" data-index-in-node=\\\"0\\\">Aksi Moodle LMS<\\/strong> adalah platform pembelajaran digital yang dirancang untuk mendukung literasi teknologi dan pengembangan keterampilan secara mandiri. Melalui semangat Aktif, Kolaboratif, Solutif, dan Inovatif, kami menghadirkan pengalaman belajar yang modern dan relevan dengan kebutuhan industri masa depan.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"#\\\">Read More \\u00bb<\\/a><\\/p>\",\"plugin\":\"theme_academi\"}', 1778825377, 'web', '127.0.0.1', NULL),
