(1, 0, '1', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-ID; mso-fareast-language: EN-ID; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Perhatikan kode berikut: &lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;title&gt;Web&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Halo&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;. Elemen yang berfungsi menyimpan informasi META halaman (tidak ditampilkan di browser) adalah...</span></p>', 1, '', 1, 1.0000000, 0.3333333, 'multichoice', 1, 'moodle.test:7070+260315125836+aorw3q', 1773579516, 1773579516, 2, 2),
(2, 0, '2', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-ID; mso-fareast-language: EN-ID; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Tag HTML yang paling tepat digunakan untuk membuat daftar langkah-langkah instalasi software (berurutan) adalah...</span></p>', 1, '', 1, 1.0000000, 0.3333333, 'multichoice', 1, 'moodle.test:7070+260315153128+2aEmvP', 1773588688, 1773588688, 2, 2),
(3, 0, '3', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-ID; mso-fareast-language: EN-ID; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Dalam tabel HTML, tag yang digunakan untuk menggabungkan dua kolom secara horizontal adalah...</span></p>', 1, '', 1, 1.0000000, 0.3333333, 'multichoice', 1, 'moodle.test:7070+260315153606+xlwZ7y', 1773588966, 1773588966, 2, 2),
(4, 0, '4', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-ID; mso-fareast-language: EN-ID; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Seorang designer membuat sketsa kasar tata letak halaman web menggunakan kotak dan garis tanpa warna. Dokumen yang sedang dibuat designer tersebut disebut...</span></p>', 1, '', 1, 1.0000000, 0.3333333, 'multichoice', 1, 'moodle.test:7070+260315153748+wtQwWX', 1773589068, 1773589068, 2, 2),
(5, 0, '5', '<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-ID; mso-fareast-language: EN-ID; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Kode CSS berikut: @media (max-width: 768px) { .sidebar { display: none; } } akan mengakibatkan...</span></p>', 1, '', 1, 1.0000000, 0.3333333, 'multichoice', 1, 'moodle.test:7070+260315154122+vKWUCF', 1773589282, 1773589282, 2, 2),
